WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
In the Comments sidebar, open Review links.

00:03.000 --> 00:08.000
Say who it's for, how long it works, and tick Works on every page of the site.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.500
Make the link, then copy it and send it to your reviewer.

00:12.500 --> 00:16.000
The reviewer opens the link and lands in comment mode. No account needed.

00:16.000 --> 00:23.000
They pick a block, give their name, and send a comment.

00:23.000 --> 00:28.000
With a whole-site link they can comment on any page they visit.

00:28.000 --> 00:33.500
Their name is remembered, so the next comment is quicker.
